Original scripts by Powerslave

These transformation scripts assume you have a volume or drive named TEMP:
this is where the lha archiver will temporarily uncrunch all of the
archives in the process of transforming them.

Note: you will need to provide a copy of the Lha archiver somewhere in your
logical path.

PLEASE modify these scripts to suit your system before using..

I included the ARP protect and rename commands in this archive
because they support wildcards.

Caveat: Evidentally the program stripper does not release the lock on the
DMS files quickly enough , or Cnet is unable to find anything above
UDBASE2: , I suspect the latter is the case..This causes hschk to fail in
appending your banner, but if you do not use anything above udbase2: you
should be okay, and if you do.. your still safe.. just your banner will not
be appended.

